<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67537" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηρύομαι</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ]</span>, 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μᾱρ-</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Theoc.
		</span></i> (v. infr.): aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμηρῡσάμην</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>draw up, furl</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱστία μηρύσαντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					12.170
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.889
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναῦται δ᾽ ἐμηρύσαντο νηὸς
				ἰσχάδα</span>
			<i>drew up</i> the anchor, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				761
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηρύεσθαι ἀπὸ βυθῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>C.</u>
					1.50
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. πείσματα, σχοίνους</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				10.2
			</span></i> (Antip. Sid.); <i>wind up</i> the strands of a
			torsion-engine, <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Bel.</u>
				98.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				10.5
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Thyill.
			</span></i>); <i>draw out</i> phlegm, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SA</u>
				1.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in weaving,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρόκα ἐν στήμονι μηρύσασθαι</span>
			<i>weave</i> the woof into the warp, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				538
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>wind off</i> thread, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Pr.</u>
				31.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Herm.</u>
				47
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> in 
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαρύεται περὶ χείλη
			κισσός</span> ivy <i>draws itself, winds</i> round the edge,
				<i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				1.29
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			 is found in pf., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ
				τὸν τένοντα δυσκρίτους φλέβας μεμήρυκεν</span> has
				<i>twined</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Oss.</u>
				16
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
